WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:00.930
"School Festival"

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:04.480
Are you having fun
at the school festival, everyone?

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.900
Yes! We are, ma'am!

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:10.440
I know you're looking forward to
a chance to let loose.

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:15.530
But drinking the water of life
is against the rules. Got it?

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:20.580
Yes. Thus, the probability that Captain Weiss
will cause a problem is now very low.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:21.700
Yup!

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:24.290
--Hey! I'm not that bad!

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.710
--Major! Major!
--Hey! I'm not that bad!

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:29.340
Oh, Lt. Serebryakov!

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:33.090
Lt. Serebryakov.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:33.920
Yes, ma'am!

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:36.140
You're having a good time, huh?

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:39.260
Yes! I'm having a very good time!

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:39.560
"Episode 11: It Begins! School Festival"

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:42.180
--Let's go!
--You look really happy.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:43.980
"Episode 11: It Begins! School Festival"
"Sold Out"

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:44.230
Somebody tasted too many.

00:00:44.230 --> 00:00:45.810
"Sold Out"

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:48.310
"Muscle Contest"

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:48.650
"School Festival"

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:51.730
Let's have a good time, everyone!

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:55.570
Hey, Seiya, it's a school festival!

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:57.610
Let's go inside!

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:00.030
Let's go inside.

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:03.160
We don't know what danger waits within.

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:06.870
So I'm not going in.

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:08.040
Let's go.

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:11.630
We just got here and we're leaving?

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:15.590
Come on, Seiya, let me have some fun!

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:18.550
You missed!

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:20.100
Ha, ha!

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:22.470
Shut up, Kazuma!

00:01:22.470 --> 00:01:25.730
I may not be the best,
but I can at least get one!

00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:29.980
The play's about to begin though.

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:32.270
You're distracting me, so shut up!

00:01:32.270 --> 00:01:35.190
Go on, I'll catch up!

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:39.110
--Another miss!
--Let's get going.

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:40.950
Yeah, let's do that, I guess.

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:45.160
I'll stay with Aqua. Go on ahead.

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:48.120
Emilia, you can just ignore her.

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:49.790
Don't say that.

00:01:49.790 --> 00:01:52.500
It's fine. I'll catch up.

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:54.170
Okay, if you say so.

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:55.550
See you later!

00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:59.260
I'm looking forward to the play!

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:01.680
Emilia's a total angel.

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:04.930
Let me guess what you're thinking.

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:06.540
You don't have to guess.

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:09.690
It's "I wish I could trade
her for my party of losers!"

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:11.940
It is, huh?

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:13.110
I guess you really want to

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:16.280
get up close and personal
with my explosion magic, huh?

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:18.610
Yeah, something like that.

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:23.870
Matches... Buy some matches, please!

00:02:23.870 --> 00:02:26.160
You're disgusting! Don't touch me!

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:32.290
Nobody would help the little girl.

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:36.260
--It's terrible! How could
someone do this to me?

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:39.380
--I beg you!

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:40.590
--Get lost!

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:43.640
--How much time has she spent alone?

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:47.830
It's time.

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:49.610
Yeah.

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:51.440
Hey, Kazuma.

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:52.980
Hey, it's the cheater.

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:55.690
You sound like Subaru.

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:57.820
Hey, it's Reinhard the Cheater.

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:59.360
I just said that.

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:01.570
We said the same things, huh?

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:03.160
You're good friends, huh?

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:09.410
Last time I let you guys have the starring role,
but this time, Class 1 will win.

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:10.760
I'm afraid...

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:14.290
...this time we'll win again!

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:16.170
Ains.

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:18.210
Please don't look up.

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:19.800
Just look at me from here down.

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:21.230
From here down.

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:26.220
What is this?

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:27.970
You look so cute, Naofumi!

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:30.730
You're so cute, Master!

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:33.400
This is impossible!

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:36.440
Quit whining, bro!

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:38.820
You guys are looking good!

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:40.690
--Go break a leg!

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:41.360
--That's rough.
--Go break a leg!

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:42.200
--That's rough.
--And then break the other leg!

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.990
--I sympathize.
--And then break the other leg!

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:44.820
--Wait! Why do you sympathize
--And then break the other leg!

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:46.740
--Wait! Why do you sympathize
--And then a nose! Then a spine!

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:49.540
--with him and not me!
--And then a nose! Then a spine!

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:53.420
A cute horsey!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:55.990
Thanks.

00:03:56.380 --> 00:03:58.420
You're cute, horsey.

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:01.370
Are we all making fun of me now?

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:05.010
What's up?

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:06.890
I got a message from Albedo.

00:04:07.470 --> 00:04:08.310
What is it?

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:13.440
Lord Ains, the mobile fortress Destroyer
has appeared at the school again.

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:14.260
What?

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:32.080
Albedo!

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:40.340
This is the enemy we fought before.

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:41.300
That's right.

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:47.430
That's the mobile fortress Destroyer.

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:49.850
It's got lots of legs and
it stomps on everything,

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:52.270
and for some reason, kids really like it!

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:53.640
I can really understand that!

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:55.810
It's got lots of legs and it's cute!

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:58.940
But it's also heading this way, right?

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:02.740
If we can't stop it,
the school festival is ruined, right?

00:05:02.990 --> 00:05:03.800
That's right.

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:07.410
It would ruin the performance
of a Supreme Being.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:10.150
That cannot be allowed!

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:14.200
It seems the Destroyer has returned.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.750
What's going on?

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:21.250
Is this another trick of the teachers,
like during field day?

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:24.420
It's not, unfortunatelyyyyy.

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:25.390
What?

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:31.760
It seems this world is even more
complicated than I expeeeeected.

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:36.060
The world never goes like you'll expect.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:38.270
Of course...

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:41.880
Anyway, let's go stop the Destroyer.

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:43.610
--Yes.
--Yeah. Let's do it.

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:44.820
I'm afraid...

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:49.070
...you can't!

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:50.280
Why?

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:54.920
Because your play is beginning.

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:58.580
You have to do it.

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:00.750
Is this festival that important?

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:01.880
Yes.

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:04.210
I believe it is.

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:08.730
Mr. Ros-<i>chi</i>, what happens
if we protect this world?

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:11.350
Even I don't know that.

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:17.560
But I'm sure a wonderful future
is waiting for ussss...

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:25.820
And is there really nobody in this world
you can rely upon except yourseeeelves?

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:27.150
What does that mean?

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:34.620
There's no need to worry.

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:40.000
We will destroy the Destroyer
before it can interrupt your play.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:40.920
Correct?

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:42.380
Yes. Let's do it.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:43.710
Fine.

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:45.920
I'll show you my true strength!

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:47.920
Puck, will you help me?

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.510
Of course.

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:51.680
My beautiful daughter.

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:54.560
Then we'll leave it to you.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:59.560
Albedo, Aqua, Emilia, Visha.

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:01.020
They say they'll stop it.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:02.230
Madness.

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:04.610
No, it's not.

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:05.820
What?

00:07:05.820 --> 00:07:07.990
Emilia's got Puck with her.

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:09.950
And Albedo's pretty tough, too, right?

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:13.490
In terms of simple combat strength,
she's quite powerful.

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:16.490
And you said Visha's good at defense.

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:20.160
If Aqua doesn't ruin
everything, we'll be fine.

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:23.380
I was fine a moment ago, but now I'm worried.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:24.880
Yes. Me, too.

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:27.250
There's no sense in worrying about it.

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:30.970
We have to do our jobs.

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:35.550
Subaru, I understand
your desire to go to Emilia.

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:38.310
We feel the same.

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:40.430
--But...
--Naofumi.

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:45.360
Fortunately, there's time before
Filo and I have to go on stage.

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.860
Can we go help?

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:48.600
Yes.

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:49.440
I'll go, too, then.

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:52.280
You have an important part.

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:56.660
And... you can't fight like that.

00:07:57.740 --> 00:08:02.000
Naofumi, let's entrust everything to them.

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:03.370
Naofumi!

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:04.750
Master!

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:07.920
Raphtalia. Filo.

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.760
Just don't do anything stupid.

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:11.920
Yes!

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:15.680
--Let's get going then.
--Yeah.

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:18.560
Well, Class 1 may not need to do anything.

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:21.640
Everyone will be moved to tears
at our performance...

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:23.690
You've got a lot of confidence.

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:25.270
We're pretty good, too, though.

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:29.900
Surreal. This is extremely surreal.

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:30.230
"Dressing Room 2"

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:32.320
I understand.

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:36.450
But Aqua is the fairy godmother.
If she's there...

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:40.380
That's right. Aqua's the
only one with a part.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:42.000
Megumin!

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:43.480
What is it, Kazuma?

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:45.370
You wrote the script, right?

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:46.920
Yes. Why?

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:49.710
Then you know the lines, right?

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:51.420
You take Aqua's part.

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:52.380
I refuse!

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:54.740
I'm not ready...

00:08:54.740 --> 00:08:57.390
Megumin, it's an emergency...

00:08:57.390 --> 00:09:00.100
I'm afraid I must refuse.

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:04.270
You're right. It's too tough a role for you.

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:05.130
What?

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:09.900
It's got a lot of lines. You're not ready.

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:14.950
No "normal person" could pull it off.

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:16.450
Indeed.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:18.660
Megumin's a "normal" person.

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:20.870
She would never agree to take such a risk.

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:23.870
You realize that even among the
highly intelligent crimson demons,

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:26.080
I'm considered a genius, right?

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:28.460
Listen, nobody says you have to do this.

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:34.340
Highly intelligent or not, you can't
learn all those lines by the time...

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.880
I can! It'll be easy!

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:38.590
Very well!

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:44.770
I shall become the grand wizard,
and guide Cinderella to the ball!

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:45.480
Grin.

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:48.480
I thought it was fairy godmother,
not grand wizard.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:50.400
Let it go.

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:55.360
All we have to do now is
make the play a success!

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:58.700
You're all ready?

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:00.990
We have to do our best!

00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:03.620
Are you ready, Aqua?

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:08.290
I don't like the fact that a devil is
running things, but we have a shared goal.

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.000
Let's do it!

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:18.130
Here we go, everyone!

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:21.550
Okay, let's do our best, everyone!

00:10:21.640 --> 00:11:50.787
Yeah!
